       px each) — exact match to the JS data-model read above, in EVERY
       one of the 9 captured states including post-toggle-back-to-light.
     trace1 hatch stroke — dark states: rgb(167,161,157) ~5.94:1 (nearest
       rendered pixel to #a8a29e, anti-aliased); light states: rgb(121,
       114,109) ~4.73:1 (nearest to #78716c) — consistent across every
